  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "On dit que quand le ciel s’est obscurci à\ncause des cendres d’un volcan, le feu\nd’un Pyrax aurait remplacé le soleil.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When volcanic ash darkened the\natmosphere, it is said that Volcarona’s\nfire provided a replacement for the sun.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quand il se bat, il fait pleuvoir des\nécailles enflammées de ses six ailes et\ntransforme les alentours en mer de feu.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "A sea of fire engulfs the surroundings\nof their battles, since they use their\nsix wings to scatter their ember scales.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Thought to be an embodiment of the sun,\nit appeared during a bitterly cold winter\nand saved Pokémon from freezing.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/21/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Thought to be an embodiment of the sun,\nit appeared during a bitterly cold winter\nand saved Pokémon from freezing.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "たたかいになると　６まいの　ハネから\nひのこの　りんぷんを　まきちらして\nあたり　いちめんを　ひのうみにする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "싸울 때는 6개의 날개에서\n불꽃 가루를 흩뿌려서\n주변 일대를 불바다로 만든다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quand il se bat, il fait pleuvoir des écailles\nenflammées de ses six ailes et transforme les\nalentours en mer de feu.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Schüttelt sich glühenden Staub aus seinen\nsechs Flügeln und verwandelt das Umfeld in\nein einziges Meer aus Flammen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando combate, despide escamas ardientes de sus\nseis alas y genera un mar ígneo a su alrededor.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quando lotta, sparge scaglie infuocate dalle sue\nsei ali, creando tutto intorno un mare di fuoco.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "A sea of fire engulfs the surroundings of their\nbattles, since they use their six wings to scatter\ntheir ember scales.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "戦いになると　６枚の　羽から\n火の粉の　りんぷんを　まき散らして\nあたり　一面を　火の海にする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando combate, despide escamas ardientes de sus\nseis alas y genera un mar ígneo a su alrededor.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "かざんばいで　ちじょうが　まっくらに\nなったとき　ウルガモスの　ほのおが\nたいようの　かわりに　なったという。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "화산재로 지상이 캄캄하게\n되었을 때 불카모스의 불꽃이\n태양을 대신했다고 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "On dit que quand le ciel s’est obscurci à cause\ndes cendres d’un volcan, le feu d’un Pyrax aurait\nremplacé le soleil.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es heißt, als das Land einst unter einer düsteren\nWolke aus Vulkanasche lag, übernahm es die Rolle\nder Sonne.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Antaño, las cenizas volcánicas cubrieron los cielos.\nEntonces, sus llamaradas sirvieron de sol.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si dice che quando il mondo fu oscurato da ceneri\nvulcaniche, le fiamme di Volcarona abbiano sostituito\nil sole.",
